<section aria-label="HiPP UK Organic Stage 1" class="fpo" id="fpo-template--22898950701275__pdp_product_overview_Q7mhgV"><div class="fpo__wrapper">
<div class="fpo__grid">
<div class="fpo__text"><h2 class="fpo__heading">HiPP UK Organic Stage 1</h2><div class="fpo__body"><p><strong>HiPP UK Organic Stage 1 is a certified organic infant formula built on a base of organic skimmed milk, whey, and lactose, with no added starch, corn syrup, or soy.</strong></p><p>It includes prebiotic oligosaccharides (GOS) along with DHA and ARA, the same long chain fatty acids required under EU formula regulation to support developing eyes and the nervous system.</p><p>Unlike HiPP’s German and Dutch recipes, the UK version relies on prebiotics alone rather than a combined prebiotic and probiotic blend, giving it a simpler ingredient profile for parents who prefer that approach.</p></div><div class="fpo__ideal">
<p><strong>Ideal for:</strong> Newborns from birth, as a first formula used alone or alongside breastfeeding.</p>
</div></div>
<div class="fpo__image"></div>
</div>
