<section aria-label="Product information" class="fdt" id="fdt-template--22898950701275__pdp_description_tabs_rcwY8K">
<div class="fdt__wrapper"><div class="fdt__nav" role="tablist"><button class="fdt__tab" data-fdt-tab="0" role="tab" type="button">Description</button><button class="fdt__tab" data-fdt-tab="1" role="tab" type="button">Ingredients</button><button class="fdt__tab" data-fdt-tab="2" role="tab" type="button">Nutritional Values</button><button class="fdt__tab" data-fdt-tab="3" role="tab" type="button">Preparation &amp; Feeding Guide</button><button class="fdt__tab" data-fdt-tab="b-shared_tab_Nmn69c" role="tab" type="button">Legal Disclaimer</button><button class="fdt__tab" data-fdt-tab="b-shared_tab_H8RJnW" role="tab" type="button">Preparation and Feeding Chart</button></div><div class="fdt__panel" data-fdt-panel="0" role="tabpanel">
<h2 class="fdt__heading">Description</h2>
<div class="fdt__content"><p><strong>HiPP UK Organic Stage 2 from 6 Months (800g)</strong></p>
<p><strong><em></em></strong>Carefully formulated to support your baby’s growing needs from 6 months onwards, HiPP Organic Follow On Milk is designed to complement a varied weaning diet and help fuel little adventures as they grow.</p>
<p class="" data-end="714" data-start="440"><strong data-end="486" data-start="440">✅ Nutritionally Tailored for Little Tummies¹</strong><br data-end="489" data-start="486"/>With over 60 years of research and expertise, HiPP’s organic follow on milk is made using high-quality ingredients and thoughtfully balanced nutrition to support your baby’s development, so you can focus on making memories.</p>
<p class="" data-end="773" data-start="716">Every tin is packed with essential nutrients including:</p>
<ul data-end="1127" data-start="775">
<li class="" data-end="846" data-start="775">
<strong data-end="791" data-start="777">Vitamin D²</strong> — supports the normal function of the immune system.</li>
<li class="" data-end="989" data-start="847">
<strong data-end="866" data-start="849">DHA (Omega-3)</strong> — supports normal visual development in infants up to 12 months (beneficial effect with a daily intake of 100mg of DHA).</li>
<li class="" data-end="1058" data-start="990">
<strong data-end="1014" data-start="992">Higher Iron Levels</strong> — to help meet your baby’s growing needs.</li>
<li class="" data-end="1127" data-start="1059">
<strong data-end="1088" data-start="1061">Vitamin C &amp; Folic Acid²</strong> — important for healthy development.</li>
</ul>
<p class="" data-end="1299" data-start="1129"><strong data-end="1158" data-start="1129">🍼 Smarter Design, Less Mess</strong><br data-end="1161" data-start="1158"/>Now packed in a durable, easy-to-use tin with an improved scoop leveler — making each feed simpler and helping to reduce wasted powder.</p>
<p class="" data-end="1476" data-start="1301"><strong data-end="1330" data-start="1301">♻️100% Recyclable Packaging</strong><br data-end="1333" data-start="1330"/>Designed with a brighter, greener future in mind — fully recyclable packaging to help care for the planet while you care for your little one.</p>
<p class="" data-end="1656" data-start="1478"><strong data-end="1516" data-start="1478">📱On-Pack Support at Your Fingertips</strong><br data-end="1519" data-start="1516"/>Simply scan the QR code on the tin for instant access to helpful ‘how-to’ guides, supporting you at every step of your feeding journey.</p>
<p class="" data-end="1855" data-start="1658"><strong data-end="1693" data-start="1658">Perfect for the Weaning Journey</strong><br data-end="1696" data-start="1693"/>In addition to bottle feeding, HiPP Follow On Milk can also be used in cooking, offering a familiar taste as your little one explores new textures and flavors.</p>
<p class="" data-end="278" data-start="73"><strong data-end="89" data-start="73">Please Note:</strong><br data-end="92" data-start="89"/>This item may occasionally arrive with minor dents due to its packaging. While we carefully inspect and ship only brand-new, undamaged products, dents can sometimes occur during transit.</p>
<p class="" data-end="523" data-start="280">Unfortunately, we are unable to offer replacements or discounts for minor dents, as replacement cans may also arrive with similar imperfections. However, <strong data-end="523" data-start="434">please feel free to reach out to us — we’ll be happy to assist you in any way we can.</strong></p>
<p class="" data-end="659" data-start="525">Rest assured, <strong data-end="576" data-start="539">dented cans are still safe to use</strong> as long as the formula inside remains sealed and the powder is not exposed to air.</p>
<p class="" data-end="694" data-start="661">Thank you for your understanding!</p>
</div>
</div><div class="fdt__panel" data-fdt-panel="1" role="tabpanel">
<h2 class="fdt__heading">Ingredients</h2>
<div class="fdt__content">
<p class="styled__createTypography-sc-a1d44d56-0 uPTIy">Organic skimmed<span> </span><strong>milk</strong>, organic<span> </span><strong>lactose</strong>, organic vegetable oils (organic palm oil, organic rapeseed oil, organic sunflower oil), organic<span> </span><strong>whey</strong><span> </span>product, organic galacto-oligosaccharides from organic lactose, calcium salts of orthophosphoric acid,<span> </span><strong>fish</strong><span> </span>oil¹, potassium chloride, calcium carbonate, L-tyrosine, sodium citrate, vitamin C, L-tryptophan, magnesium carbonate, L-cystine, ferrous sulphate, zinc sulphate, niacin, vitamin E, pantothenic acid, cupric sulphate, vitamin A, vitamin B1, vitamin B6, potassium iodate, folic acid (calcium-L-methylfolate⁴), sodium selenite, manganese sulphate, vitamin K, vitamin D, D-biotin.</p>
<p class="styled__createTypography-sc-a1d44d56-0 uPTIy"><sub><em>¹Sustainably sourced</em></sub></p>
<p class="styled__createTypography-sc-a1d44d56-0 uPTIy"><sub><em>⁴Metafolin®</em></sub></p>
<p class="styled__createTypography-sc-a1d44d56-0 uPTIy">For allergens, see ingredients in<span> </span><strong>bold</strong>.</p>
<p>Please keep in mind that this product is made to meet European standards for iron and other nutritional criteria. Since there is no single global standard for these nutrients, requirements may vary by region, and additional supplementation may sometimes be needed to meet local dietary recommendations.</p>
</div>
</div><div class="fdt__panel" data-fdt-panel="2" role="tabpanel">
<h2 class="fdt__heading">Nutritional Values</h2>
<div class="fdt__content">
<p>Per 100ml or 3.38 oz/3 oz prepared<br/>Energy 285kJ/68kcal<br/>Fat 3.7g<br/>of which: saturates 1.6g<br/>of which: monounsaturates 1.6g<br/>of which: polyunsaturates 0.5g<br/>of which:    <br/>Linoleic acid (omega-6) 0.42g<br/>α-linolenic acid (ALA/omega-3) 0.06g<br/>Docosahexaenoic acid (DHA/omega-3) 13.6mg<br/>Carbohydrates 7.2g<br/>of which: sugars 7.2g<br/>of which: lactose 7.0g<br/>Fibre 0.4g<br/>of which: Galacto-oligosaccharides (GOS) 0.4g<br/>Protein 1.3g<br/>Minerals    <br/>Sodium 20mg<br/>Potassium 88mg<br/>Chloride 52mg<br/>Calcium 77mg<br/>Phosphorus 44mg<br/>Magensium 6.3mg<br/>Iron 1.0mg<br/>Zinc 0.5mg<br/>Copper 0.054mg<br/>Manganese 0.0070mg<br/>Fluoride &lt;0.010mg<br/>Selenium 3.9µg<br/>Iodine 15µg<br/>Vitamins    <br/>Vitamin A 56µg<br/>Vitamin D 1.6µg (23%)**<br/>Vitamin E 0.80µg<br/>Vitamin K 3.9µg<br/>Vitamin C 10mg<br/>Thiamin (B1) 0.051mg<br/>Riboflavin (B2) 0.15mg<br/>Niacin 0.53mg<br/>Vitamin B6 0.042mg<br/>Folic Acid 11.3µg<br/>Vitamin B12 0.10µg<br/>Biotin 1.6µg<br/>Pantothenic Acid 0.35mg<br/></p>
<p>†Typical values per 100 ml prepared feed     <br/>The above analytical values are subject to the normal variations that occur with products made from natural ingredients     <br/> <br/>HiPP Organic follow on milk is not suitable for vegetarians.</p>
</div>
</div><div class="fdt__panel" data-fdt-panel="3" role="tabpanel">
<h2 class="fdt__heading">Preparation &amp; Feeding Guide</h2>
<div class="fdt__content">
<h3 class="" data-end="182" data-start="126">💡<strong data-end="398" data-start="351">How to Prepare HiPP Organic Follow-On Milk:</strong>
</h3>
<ol data-end="1236" data-start="402">
<li class="" data-end="521" data-start="402">Wash your hands thoroughly and sterilise all bottles, teats, and equipment as per the manufacturer’s instructions.</li>
<li class="" data-end="660" data-start="522">Boil 1 litre of fresh water and allow it to cool for no longer than 30 minutes. Avoid using artificially softened or re-boiled water.</li>
<li class="" data-end="762" data-start="661">Refer to the Feeding Guide and pour the correct amount of cooled water into a sterilised bottle.</li>
<li class="" data-end="923" data-start="763">Using the provided scoop, add 1 level scoop of powder for every 30ml (1 fl oz) of water. Use the scoop leveller to level the powder — do not press it down.</li>
<li class="" data-end="1047" data-start="924">Place the sterilised teat and cap on the bottle. Shake well for about 15 seconds until the powder has fully dissolved.</li>
<li class="" data-end="1236" data-start="1048">Cool the bottle to a safe feeding temperature (around 37°C) by holding it under cold running water. Always check the milk temperature before feeding. Feed immediately after preparation.</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="" data-end="1239" data-start="1208">🧊 <strong data-end="1262" data-start="1243">Storage Advice:</strong>
</h3>
<ul data-end="1436" data-start="1266">
<li class="" data-end="1326" data-start="1266">Store the tin in a cool, dry place — do not refrigerate.</li>
<li class="" data-end="1361" data-start="1327">Use within 3 weeks of opening.</li>
<li class="" data-end="1414" data-start="1362">Packed in a protective atmosphere for freshness.</li>
</ul>
<div>
<table border="0">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<p>Amount of cooled boiled water per feedfl oz</p>
</td>
<td>ml</td>
<td>Number of level scoops of powder per feed</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>5</td>
<td>150</td>
<td>5 scoops</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>6</td>
<td>180</td>
<td>6 scoops</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div> </div>
<div>
<p class="" data-end="241" data-start="70">From around 6 months, babies typically need about <strong data-end="164" data-start="120">500–600ml of HiPP Organic Follow-On Milk</strong> each day — either as a drink, mixed with cereals, or added to other foods.</p>
<p class="" data-end="448" data-start="243">Every baby is different, so this is just a general guide. Your little one may need more or less depending on their individual needs. If you're unsure, your healthcare professional will be happy to advise!</p>
</div></div>
